{"name":"Cherished","hex":"#ba97b1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cherished","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["highly valued, having a high personal value."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of cherish"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cherished"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cherished","blocks":[{"text":"Cherished is the fourteenth studio album by American singer-actress Cher, released on June 4, 1977, as Cher's final studio album released by Warner Bros. Records. This album, like several other predecessors, was a commercial failure and failed to chart. The album was promoted by the release of the lead single, \"Pirate\" which charted at No. 93 on the Billboard Hot 100 and a second single, \"War Paint and Soft Feathers\" which failed to chart. \"Pirate\" was the only single from the 70s Warner era to chart despite the album being her lowest selling album of her entire career."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e2/Cherished.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cherished","wikidata":"Q965141"},{"title":"Cherished (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Cherished is a single British true crime drama, written by acclaimed screenwriter Gwyneth Hughes, that first broadcast on BBC One on 22 February 2005. Starring Sarah Lancashire as protagonist Angela Cannings, the drama is based on Cannings' wrongful conviction for the deaths of two of her infant children, Jason and Matthew. Directed by Robin Sheppard, the drama also stars Timothy Spall as Angela's husband Terry, Emma Cunniffe as Angela's sister Claire; and Ian McNeice as her defence barrister; Bill Bache. The drama was a joint production between the BBC's drama and current affairs wings. 5.18 million viewers tuned in for the initial broadcast. Similarly to other true-life BBC productions of the time; Cherished has never been released on DVD."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/14/CherishedSarahLancashire.jpg/330px-CherishedSarahLancashire.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cherished_(film)","wikidata":"Q2005975"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Floribunda - Cherish 6 (cr) (cropped)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Floribunda_-_Cherish_6_%28cr%29_%28cropped%29.JPG/500px-Floribunda_-_Cherish_6_%28cr%29_%28cropped%29.JPG","ratio":1.1425287356321838,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Floribunda_-_Cherish_6_(cr)_(cropped).JPG","share":0.1825},{"title":"Floribunda - Cherish 6 (cr)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Floribunda_-_Cherish_6_%28cr%29.JPG/500px-Floribunda_-_Cherish_6_%28cr%29.JPG","ratio":1.7777777777777777,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Floribunda_-_Cherish_6_(cr).JPG","share":0.13625},{"title":"Purple rain on roof","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Purple_rain_on_roof.jpg/500px-Purple_rain_on_roof.jpg","ratio":1.5389863547758285,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Purple_rain_on_roof.jpg","share":0.120625},{"title":"Purple Sky Sunset","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Purple_Sky_Sunset.jpg/500px-Purple_Sky_Sunset.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Purple_Sky_Sunset.jpg","share":0.105},{"title":"Illuminated white and purple facade of the office building Rohm Semiconductor in Kyoto, Japan","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Illuminated_white_and_purple_facade_of_the_office_building_Rohm_Semiconductor_in_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg/500px-Illuminated_white_and_purple_facade_of_the_office_building_Rohm_Semiconductor_in_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg","ratio":1.3332270408163265,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Illuminated_white_and_purple_facade_of_the_office_building_Ro